  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Central Continent Immortal Gu Houses in black heaven have just stopped when a swarm of ants approaches.",
        "chapters": [
          1242
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_central_continent",
          "sys_immortal_gu_house"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu Immortals call out Nether ant Gu and shout to run. The three Immortal Gu Houses are forced to flee again.",
        "chapters": [
          1242
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "encounter-in-black-heaven",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Soon after, countless nether ant Gu surround the three Immortal Gu Houses like waves of black river currents, and the Houses are encircled by a soul beast army.",
        "chapters": [
          1243
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "encounter-in-black-heaven",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Outside the Houses, the ants appear with soul beast figures among them as a massive army whose auras join together. That force includes many ancient and immemorial soul beasts, and the Gu Immortals also sense the auras of many wild Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1244
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "encounter-in-black-heaven",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_wild_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Within black heaven, countless soul beasts form into hordes that often rampage with nether ants paving the way, and those hordes often hold hundreds of thousands or even millions of soul beasts.",
        "chapters": [
          1968
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "black-heaven-pattern",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
